{"availability":"available","full":"vincenzo-afk/roastmycode","name":"roastmycode","description":"Paste your code and get brutally roasted by AI — then refactored into something actually worth shipping.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":37,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-20T16:42:48Z","updated":"2026-08-23T04:51:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://roastmycode-lemon.vercel.app","topics":["ai","ai-code-review","code-analysis","code-quality","code-refactoring","code-review","developer-experience","developer-tools","generative-ai","groq","html","javascript","llm","serverless","vercel","web-app"],"demo":"https://roastmycode-lemon.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:15.396Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:15.396Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:15.396Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:15.396Z","stars":37,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI-powered code roaster and refactoring tool for developers who value memorable feedback.","Live application · Documentation · Report a bug · Request a feature","ROASTMYCODE is a browser-based developer tool that turns a submitted code sample into a structured AI code roast. It is designed to make technical feedback specific and engaging: the result includes a personality-driven roast, code-quality metrics, a code-alignment label, a worst-crime diagnosis, a suggested commit message, and a final verdict. It also provides a separate emergency-refactor flow that returns cleaned-up code with a damage assessment."],"features":["Eight roast modes: Funny, Strict Professor, Hacker, Anime Villain, Gordon Ramsay, Passive Aggressive, Shakespeare, and Tamil Villain.","Streaming roast delivery with ten pain-score fields and an expected structured result contract.","Emergency refactoring that returns a roast, revised code, damage assessment, and list of fixes.","JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, Ruby, Rust, Java, C, C++, G